Package: soundcloud-cardputer
Version: 1.0.0
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Egor <egorkhlud9-cell@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-pygame, mpv, yt-dlp
Description: Native SoundCloud player for Cardputer Zero
 Native SDL/Pygame interface with MPV audio playback, SoundCloud OAuth 2.1
 PKCE sign-in, account library synchronization and local playlists.
